5K. 8K. 8K. 7K. 7K. 6K. 5K. Same jumps people still talk about from that live. This is the WLR-era IG live. Red dreads, tank, dancing in the room. The song tied to that run is “New Tank” off Whole Lotta Red , the record he previewed on live before the Christmas 2020 drop. That live peaked around 131K. Whole Lotta Red debuted at No. 1 on the Billboard 200 with 100,000 first-week units and 126 million streams that week.

